        "ggHuHX3S-kc_text": "<span style=\"color:#3B2364;\">MenoMate: </span>The Missing Link Between <span style=\"color:#3B2364;\">Hormones and Pain-Free Side Sleeping</span>",
        "ggjLxIlkOju_text": "<span style=\"color:#772B90;\">The 90-Day Transformation&nbsp;</span><br>Your Hip Tendons Experience with MenoMate:",
        "ggtlCKk-zWC_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;font-size:22px;\"><strong>Day 1- 30</strong></span><br><strong>Initial Relief Phase&nbsp;</strong><br>Your body begins absorbing MenoMate's specialized Cur-Biotic complex, initiating the restoration of hormonal balance crucial for tendon health. Many women report noticeable reduction in discomfort within the first two weeks.</p>",
        "ggaUDRPxbpp_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;font-size:22px;\"><strong>Days 31-60</strong></span></p><p><strong>Cellular Rejuvenation Phase</strong></p><p>The proprietary blend of turmeric compounds and targeted probiotics accelerates tendon regeneration at the cellular level. Mobility improves as tendon tissue regains structural integrity.</p>",
        "ggOH7v8WN4F_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;font-size:22px;\"><strong>Days 61-90</strong></span></p><p><strong>Comprehensive Restoration Phase</strong></p><p>Your tendons reach optimal functional strength, allowing full side-sleeping comfort and unrestricted daily movement. The transformation is complete — with continued support to maintain your newfound freedom.</p>",
        "gUAgLNqbwstvV_text": "<p>While conventional treatments focus solely on reducing inflammation, MenoMate's revolutionary formula addresses what cutting-edge research has identified as the true root cause of menopausal hip discomfort: hormonal changes that directly impact tendon strength and resilience.</p>",
        "ggou1zKd1M7_text": "<p>“I used to dread mornings because of the stiffness. Now, I actually look forward to getting out of bed—I feel limber and ready to go!”</p>",
        "ggi13R4u4-A_text": "<p>Jennifer M.</p>",
        "gg3guFjWQKd_text": "Verified buyer"
      }
    },
