      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ea9316d88a2b76a52aee23ec207e2521a8a273bfbaf0de25fe63513c00ead1b9_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gszYGqLzOBmUe_text": "<p>Over <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">682,700+</span> Women Are Sleeping Comfortably Again After Discovering MenoMate</p>",
        "gkzvDKVxbbZMn_text": "<p><i>\"After 3 years of interrupted sleep, I was desperate. Rolling onto my side meant shooting pain that would wake me instantly. Within 6 weeks of starting MenoMate, that familiar deep ache began fading. By day 78, I slept through the night on my side for the first time in years. My husband says I'm like a different person now that I'm actually getting restorative sleep.\"</i></p>",
