        "ggR62jx6rct_text": "<p>Chicago, IL</p>",
        "gdibeONFxMzze_text": "Verified buyer",
        "giPpISqNpXyua_text": "<p><i>\"I was skeptical of ANYTHING claiming to help with hip pain. I've tried literally everything — physical therapy, injections, even prescription medications. Nothing provided lasting relief. MenoMate changed everything. I noticed improved flexibility by week 2, and by week 8, I could garden for hours without that familiar ache returning. I'm now on my fourth bottle and won't go a day without it.\"</i></p>",
        "ggOCh3t-eUS_text": "<p>Donna Sullivan, 59</p>",
        "ggMqm9K6g96_text": "<p>Atlanta, GA</p>",
        "gg2LGafJcso_text": "Verified buyer",
        "gTSVppQVRPihz_text": "<p><i>\"The deep aching in my hip used to wake me 5-6 times each night. I'd have to flip to my back, then eventually try my side again. The cycle was exhausting. MenoMate reduced my pain from an 8/10 to a 2/10 in just 52 days. I'm actually excited to go to bed now because I know I'll wake up rested instead of more exhausted than when I went to sleep.\"</i></p>",
